### Stray JAR / decompiler dump at the repository root ###
# A NeoForge jar was once extracted into the repo root. These are NOT project
# sources: the real ones live under StardustIndustry-*/src/main/. Each pattern
# is anchored with a leading slash so the modules' own assets/data directories
# are never ignored. Verified contents:
#   com/mojang, net/minecraft, net/neoforged  -> unpacked classes
#   assets/{c,minecraft,neoforge}, data/{...} -> vanilla/mod resources
#   META-INF/                                 -> NeoForge manifest + mods.toml
#   mcp/client                                -> decompiler cache
#   neoforge.mixins.json                      -> package net.neoforged.neoforge.mixins
#   pack.mcmeta                               -> pack.neoforge.description
/assets/
/data/
/com/
/net/
/mcp/
/META-INF/
/reports/
/mcplogo.png
/neoforged_logo.png
/url.png
/forge.exc
/forge.sas
/forge.srg
/neoforge.mixins.json
/pack.mcmeta

### NOTE: the directories above are kept on disk ON PURPOSE (vanilla/NeoForge
### sources for reference). They are ignored by Git, by the IDE indexer
### (.idea/fileIndexingSettings.xml) and by Gradle (build.gradle.kts excludes).
### Do not delete them; do not un-ignore them.
